{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U7YvJCnNmnwJHKqb4P5YaH","type":"tool_result","content":"4904\tdef submit_dream_review_report(\n4905\t    report: str,\n4906\t    project: str,\n4907\t    tier: str,\n4908\t    dream_id: str,\n4909\t    overall_score: str = \"\",\n4910\t    review_chat_id: str = \"\",\n4911\t    review_visible: bool = True,\n4912\t) -> str:\n4913\t    \"\"\"Deliver a Dream-mode review report (Dream Review Director only).\n4914\t\n4915\t    Persists the review to ``dream_reports/{dream_id}/{tier}/review_report.md``\n4916\t    and (optionally) posts a Group C visibility card. The Dream Tool reads\n4917\t    the file once your subprocess exits — there is NO Research Director\n4918\t    delivery, NO ``review_reports/round_N.md``, NO ``review_issues.yaml``,\n4919\t    and NO 5-step protocol attached.\n4920\t\n4921\t    Use this in place of ``submit_review_report_to_research_director`` for\n4922\t    Dream-mode roundtable Step 4. See DREAM_AGENT_DESIGN.md §6.4.\n4923\t\n4924\t    Args:\n4925\t        report: Consolidated review report text (covers all Dream reviewers).\n4926\t        project: Current project name.\n4927\t        tier: Which Dream tier this report covers — ``best`` / ``median``\n4928\t            / ``worst``.\n4929\t        dream_id: Dream invocation id (with or without the ``dream_`` prefix —\n4930\t            both accepted).\n4931\t        overall_score: Optional headline assessment (\"strong reject\",\n4932\t            \"borderline accept\", etc.).\n4933\t        review_chat_id: Group C chat_id (loaded from project config when empty).\n4934\t        review_visible: When True (default) posts a visibility card to Group C\n4935\t            with a ``[Dream]`` prefix. Set False for silent submission.\n4936\t    \"\"\"\n4937\t    result = feishu_group_mod.submit_dream_review_report(\n4938\t        report=report,\n4939\t        project=project,\n4940\t        tier=tier,\n4941\t        dream_id=dream_id,\n4942\t        overall_score=overall_score,\n4943\t        review_chat_id=review_chat_id,\n4944\t        review_visible=review_visible,\n4945\t    )\n4946\t    return _tool_result_to_str(result)\n4947\t\n4948\t\n4949\t@mcp.tool()\n4950\tdef request_external_review(\n4951\t    project: str,\n4952\t    paper_pdf_path: str,\n4953\t    venue: str = \"\",\n4954\t    note: str = \"\",\n4955\t    chat_id: str = \"\",\n4956\t    reminder_hours: int = 8,\n4957\t) -> str:\n4958\t    \"\"\"Request human-assisted external review via Stanford Agentic Reviewer (paperreview.ai).\n4959\t\n4960\t    Sends an interactive card to the user group (Group A) with instructions\n4961\t    to manually submit the paper PDF on paperreview.ai.  A reminder is\n4962\t    automatically scheduled after ``reminder_hours`` to follow up.\n4963\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ATD3Eexf43tUXSera5hnLE","session_id":"7a809893-9edf-45cd-a05c-395ee786b54e","uuid":"80301343-7723-4f97-bade-b338c3332fce","timestamp":"2026-05-11T23:47:37.114Z"}
